@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Graderate

[*] --> WaitingState

state "Waiting state" as WaitingState
state "Active state" as ActiveState
state "Expired state" as ExpiredState
state "Archived state" as ArchivedState

WaitingState --> ActivateRate : start date arrives
ActivateRate : entry / current date equals or surpasses start date
ActivateRate : do / activate rate
ActivateRate : exit / rate activated

ActivateRate --> ActiveState

ActiveState --> MaintainActiveState : end of validity period not reached
MaintainActiveState : entry / end of validity period not reached
MaintainActiveState : do / maintain active state
MaintainActiveState : exit / finish date reached

MaintainActiveState --> ExpireRate : finish date reached

ExpireRate : entry / finish date reached
ExpireRate : do / mark rate as expired
ExpireRate : exit / one year from expiration date not yet passed

ExpireRate --> WaitingState : one year from expiration date not yet passed

WaitingState --> RemoveRate : one year from expiration date passed

RemoveRate : entry / one year from expiration date passed
RemoveRate : do / remove or archive rate
RemoveRate : exit / rate removed or archived

[*] --> ArchivedState : rate removed or archived

@enduml
